stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> READY : Process Created & Enqueued (Flight Enters ReadyQueue)
    
    READY --> RUNNING : Scheduler Dispatches Process (Runway Allocated Exclusively)
    READY --> READY : Priority Aging Applied (Decrements Numerical Value Towards 1)
    READY --> READY : Emergency Declared (Effective Priority Set to 1)
    
    RUNNING --> BLOCKED : Operational Resource Suspension / Holding
    BLOCKED --> READY : Resource Restored / Re-enqueued in ReadyQueue
    
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED : Flight Concludes Service (Runway Released & Transaction Committed)
    
    COMPLETED --> [*] : Metrics Recorded (Turnaround & Waiting Times Finalized)
